<div class="line-numbers" aria-hidden="true" style="counter-reset:line-number 0"><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div><div class="line-number"></div></div></div><p>而每个接收任务从自己的队列里接收消息，然后做相应的处理：</p>
<div class="language-c line-numbers-mode" data-highlighter="shiki" data-ext="c" style="--shiki-light:#393a34;--shiki-dark:#dbd7caee;--shiki-light-bg:#ffffff;--shiki-dark-bg:#121212"><pre class="shiki shiki-themes vitesse-light vitesse-dark vp-code" v-pre=""><code class="language-c"><span class="line"><span style="--shiki-light:#A0ADA0;--shiki-dark:#758575DD">/* 显示任务：从自己的队列收消息，更新界面 */</span></span>
